==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{der|is|non|liggja}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*ligjaną}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*legʰ-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈlɪcːa/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ɪcːa|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|lá|lágu|legið}}

# to [[lie]] (on a bed etc.)
# to be [[located]], to [[lie]]
# to [[lead]] (e.g. of a road)

